WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,410 --> 00:00:05,010
I'd like to see it

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:08,970
How did the Lord of Peach Grove undertake the construction of you, a bug who breaks the rules?

3
00:00:08,970 --> 00:00:13,990
Tomorrow morning Taocheng East

4
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:16,230
I want to pull out your thorns one by one

5
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:17,550
Let you run naked

6
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:21,030
Tomorrow, those who don’t come tomorrow are meat worms

7
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:24,100
Yes, yes, no, the meat bugs are waiting for you.

8
00:00:24,100 --> 00:00:29,510
Boss, I’ve already met 28 of them along the way.

9
00:00:29,510 --> 00:00:31,390
Enough? Enough?

10
00:00:31,390 --> 00:00:34,190
28 of them, they are still raw enough no matter what.

11
00:00:34,190 --> 00:00:41,250
Ahead is where the Lord of the Peach Grove is

12
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:42,290
Stop communicating

13
00:00:42,410 --> 00:00:43,570
Low-key online fruit

14
00:00:43,570 --> 00:00:44,850
Then just leave
